OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BSouth Africa win 'sets us up nicely' - 
OL,5,BFarrell                                
OL,6,GAfter Ireland's win over world         
OL,7,Gchampions South Africa on Saturday,    
OL,8,GAndy Farrell had one eye on the past,  
OL,9,Gand another on what is to come.        
OL,11,FIt was a result that had left          
OL,12,FIreland's head coach brimming with     
OL,13,Fpride, as they ended a run of six      
OL,14,Fstraight defeats against either the    
OL,15,FSpringboks, New Zealand or France.     
OL,17,FWith the World Cup now just 10 months  
OL,18,Faway, it is all part of the bigger     
OL,19,Fpicture as Ireland aim to progress     
OL,20,Fpast the quarter-finals for the first  
OL,21,Ftime, with the ultimate goal of        
OL,22,Flifting the Webb Ellis Cup.       G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
