OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BThree years on NI Women finally have   
OL,5,Bfriendlies again                       
OL,6,GTuesday, 18 July 2023 was the last     
OL,7,Gtime Northern Ireland Women played a   
OL,8,Gfriendly.                              
OL,10,FUnder interim manager Gail Redmond, NI 
OL,11,Fproduced a fine display to beat Czech  
OL,12,FRepublic 2-0 in Opava.                 
OL,14,FJust over three and a half years       
OL,15,Flater, Northern Ireland will have not  
OL,16,Fone but two friendly fixtures, with    
OL,17,FMichael McArdle's side taking on       
OL,18,FGreece in an Inver Park double-header  
OL,19,Fon 27 November and 1 December.         
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
